blog-line--center\">宝可梦中心大阪的\n    <br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">签名会！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从东京乘坐希望号新干线</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">大约2小时30分钟！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n这个形状可是功能美学啊！\n我最喜欢N700A了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后……\n令人震撼的……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n诶？！\n\n新干线下车后\n\n大家马上都靠右站着？！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/003-7f50af14eb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/003-7f50af14eb.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n自动扶梯靠右站！\n（靠左通行！）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n大家都站在右边，吓了我一跳！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n去看了看明天抽签举行的地方！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/004-e53a5fc1f7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/004-e53a5fc1f7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n大家要来哦！\n期待和大家见面！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后去吃慢悠悠的晚餐！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/005-35301345fc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/005-35301345fc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n带我去了一家很棒的铁板烧店哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/006-68ca1d7cb5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/006-68ca1d7cb5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n（右上角三角形的魔芋和大阪烧也超级美味！）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n                    超级好吃！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大阪\n太厉害了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n                    然后\n                \n正在为我们烤制的是……\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/007-4f729f265c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/007-4f729f265c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n笑容很棒的她！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n铁板烧非常美味，\n味道、火候和\n整体平衡都无可挑剔！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大阪太厉害了\n真是博大精深！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n然后，今晚大阪的月亮是……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/008-1d3dc554e6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/008-1d3dc554e6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n神秘！\n\n<br>\n\n明天的签名会，好期待啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/001-2276a4fe7b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3737700/001-2276a4fe7b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">大阪到着！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\